WEBVTT

00:15.480 --> 00:17.980
<b>Ooh, they all look so good!</b>

00:18.600 --> 00:19.360
<b>This one…</b>

00:19.450 --> 00:21.290
<b>Miyoshi, it's that thing you like!</b>

00:21.290 --> 00:23.100
<b>I know. Get to work.</b>

00:23.420 --> 00:25.690
<b>Oh! This one's fresh out the fryer!</b>

00:25.740 --> 00:27.100
<b>I'm taking one, Hidaka!</b>

00:27.110 --> 00:29.390
<b>Dumbass! I haven't plated that yet!</b>

00:30.420 --> 00:32.060
<b>Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!</b>

00:32.060 --> 00:34.590
<b>That was a delicious crunch. A nice, sharp fa.</b>

00:34.700 --> 00:38.770
<b>Otowa's amazing, being able
to pick out notes like that.</b>

00:38.860 --> 00:42.510
<b>Is that a surprise, after all the
singing lessons you took together?</b>

00:43.330 --> 00:45.290
<b>Everyone got their drinks?</b>

00:45.440 --> 00:46.810
<b>- Yup.
- Sure do.</b>

00:50.100 --> 00:52.570
<b>As thanks for saving Shizuka,</b>

00:53.090 --> 00:55.820
<b>and to welcome Suzuri,</b>

00:55.860 --> 01:00.120
<b>\h\h\h\hHidaka Diner\h\h\h\h</b>

00:56.360 --> 01:00.110
<b>eat and drink your fill. It's all on me.</b>

01:00.840 --> 01:01.620
<b>And with that…</b>

01:02.010 --> 01:03.570
<b>Cheeeers!</b>

01:03.690 --> 01:05.370
<b>Cheers!</b>

01:07.390 --> 01:08.940
<b>Now, let's dig in!</b>

01:09.120 --> 01:11.530
<b>This juice is so tasty, Hidaka!</b>

01:11.790 --> 01:12.780
<b>I like it, too!</b>

01:12.900 --> 01:14.720
<b>I want to sell it at my place!</b>

01:14.920 --> 01:16.510
<b>It's our own original recipe!</b>

01:16.840 --> 01:20.970
<b>Okay, let me know if there's anything
you want. I'll serve you some.</b>

01:30.140 --> 01:32.370
<b>Cut it out, guys!</b>

01:32.930 --> 01:35.890
<b>There's no sense dwelling on the past!</b>

01:36.570 --> 01:40.650
<b>Or what? Are you saying you
can't eat food I serve you?</b>

01:40.810 --> 01:42.510
<b>Th-That's not it!</b>

01:43.550 --> 01:44.760
<b>It's just…</b>

01:45.740 --> 01:49.120
<b>I can't act like everything's
normal after that happened.</b>

01:56.910 --> 01:58.250
<b>That bastard…</b>

01:59.770 --> 02:01.260
<b>I'll get him for that!</b>

03:34.410 --> 03:37.600
<b>That aside, will you guys be okay?</b>

03:37.930 --> 03:40.760
<b>Didn't somebody hire you to take Shizuka in?</b>

03:41.480 --> 03:42.460
<b>Good point…</b>

03:42.680 --> 03:43.440
<b>Right?</b>

03:43.660 --> 03:45.280
<b>This can't be good…</b>

03:45.530 --> 03:46.520
<b>We'll be okay.</b>

03:47.040 --> 03:48.960
<b>I'll talk it over somehow.</b>

03:49.670 --> 03:50.990
<b>Talk it over, huh?</b>

03:53.560 --> 03:56.430
<b>Who'd listen to a bunch of losers?</b>

03:56.570 --> 03:58.770
<b>You went and did a half-assed job.</b>

03:59.550 --> 04:02.220
<b>I seriously suck at judging people.</b>

04:02.910 --> 04:07.220
<b>But hey, Furin put another good card in my hand.</b>

04:08.380 --> 04:10.040
<b>How'd he know we're Furin?</b>

04:10.330 --> 04:11.780
<b>We're not in our uniforms.</b>

04:11.880 --> 04:13.220
<b>Why…</b>

04:13.580 --> 04:15.690
<b>Why are you here?!</b>

04:16.010 --> 04:19.990
<b>Shut up. I go where I want.</b>

04:20.730 --> 04:22.880
<b>I always have.</b>

04:23.260 --> 04:26.070
<b>Wherever's fun. Wherever feels good.</b>

04:27.050 --> 04:32.020
<b>My whole life is just killing time until I die.</b>

04:33.210 --> 04:34.500
<b>Who is this guy?</b>

04:36.350 --> 04:38.320
<b>Tsubakino seems to know him.</b>

04:56.600 --> 05:00.900
<b>Ooooooooowwwwww!</b>

05:01.110 --> 05:04.320
<b>Why's it hurt so bad to jump
from above the second floor?!</b>

05:04.920 --> 05:07.640
<b>TV shows always make it seem so much cooler!</b>

05:08.170 --> 05:10.580
<b>What the hell? Is this a joke?</b>

05:17.550 --> 05:20.880
<b>Sakura, you guys stay out of this.</b>

05:21.240 --> 05:24.410
<b>You've got some nerve, showing
your face around here.</b>

05:24.830 --> 05:25.700
<b>What?</b>

05:26.510 --> 05:28.340
<b>Why's he so pissed off?</b>

05:29.610 --> 05:33.080
<b>Come on, now. This is a big reunion.</b>

05:33.510 --> 05:36.400
<b>If you're gonna put out that ready-to-rumble aura…</b>

05:40.760 --> 05:43.370
<b>then I'm gonna have some real fun.</b>

05:51.930 --> 05:53.930
<b>Ooh, so cool.</b>

05:54.780 --> 05:57.120
<b>Even the kids are stanced up.</b>

05:58.570 --> 06:00.540
<b>Your business is with me.</b>

06:03.070 --> 06:04.440
<b>They're not part of this.</b>

06:07.920 --> 06:09.780
<b>Let's talk, one on one.</b>

06:10.970 --> 06:11.980
<b>Somewhere else.</b>

06:15.560 --> 06:16.260
<b>I see.</b>

06:17.520 --> 06:18.880
<b>That's how it is.</b>

06:20.540 --> 06:22.000
<b>It was you.</b>

06:23.390 --> 06:25.050
<b>This was all your doing.</b>

06:32.730 --> 06:36.680
<b>And you came outta nowhere.
Who the hell even are you?</b>

06:39.350 --> 06:43.000
<b>Hey, Tsubaki. Introduce me to the new kids.</b>

06:43.410 --> 06:45.100
<b>It's just awkward right now.</b>

06:48.450 --> 06:49.400
<b>This guy…</b>

06:50.880 --> 06:53.600
<b>is a former Furin student, the same year as me.</b>

06:54.750 --> 06:56.160
<b>Endo Yamato.</b>

07:00.000 --> 07:01.520
<b>The former Furin…</b>

07:02.410 --> 07:03.310
<b>Endo…</b>

07:03.880 --> 07:05.990
<b>Huh? Spit it out!</b>

07:06.660 --> 07:08.970
<b>Even I've heard about this guy.</b>

07:10.280 --> 07:13.150
<b>Everybody in Furin knows that name!</b>

07:13.890 --> 07:15.600
<b>He's a legend!</b>

07:18.100 --> 07:19.600
<b>You're making me blush!</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:22.490
<b>Even if it's just a firstie saying it.</b>

07:24.670 --> 07:25.550
<b>What?</b>

07:27.950 --> 07:29.690
<b>Some legend.</b>

07:32.300 --> 07:33.570
<b>Sakura, don't…</b>

07:33.580 --> 07:35.400
<b>I don't care about your legend.</b>

07:36.350 --> 07:39.690
<b>You're the type of guy who hires
others to kidnap somebody!</b>

07:40.540 --> 07:42.080
<b>A piece of shit!</b>

07:48.010 --> 07:50.800
<b>A piece of shit, huh?</b>

07:52.200 --> 07:54.200
<b>Well, that's just no good!</b>

07:54.380 --> 07:58.590
<b>We can't have the town heroes,
Furin, using that kind of language!</b>

07:59.710 --> 08:01.060
<b>But more importantly…</b>

08:01.760 --> 08:05.600
<b>I see. So you're Sakura, then?</b>

08:07.130 --> 08:08.570
<b>That hair,</b>

08:09.310 --> 08:10.280
<b>and those eyes…</b>

08:11.320 --> 08:14.210
<b>You were with the guys fighting KEEL.</b>

08:16.270 --> 08:18.450
<b>I saw it all.</b>

08:19.290 --> 08:21.260
<b>When you charged in alone,</b>

08:21.980 --> 08:25.630
<b>and when you struggled after you lost your focus.</b>

08:26.810 --> 08:28.330
<b>It hit me back then.</b>

08:29.000 --> 08:29.980
<b>Sakura…</b>

08:31.080 --> 08:34.210
<b>Guys like you don't belong at Furin.</b>

08:35.980 --> 08:38.980
<b>You should drop out already. That kinda thing.</b>

08:43.470 --> 08:44.670
<b>That's…</b>

08:44.830 --> 08:46.890
<b>That's not true at all!</b>

08:48.810 --> 08:53.260
<b>Wh-What do you know about Sakura?!</b>

08:54.900 --> 08:57.210
<b>Please don't spout nonsense like that!</b>

08:57.480 --> 09:00.680
<b>Whoa, there! Your voice is cracking all over!</b>

09:07.480 --> 09:08.800
<b>And what's this about?</b>

09:09.100 --> 09:10.880
<b>Take back what you said.</b>

09:11.060 --> 09:13.070
<b>What? I was just…</b>

09:14.860 --> 09:17.610
<b>Nobody's a better fit for Furin than him!</b>

09:17.900 --> 09:20.400
<b>You're not even Furin. How would you know?</b>

09:21.090 --> 09:24.560
<b>In that case, would a Furin student know better?</b>

09:35.050 --> 09:36.250
<b>Well, damn.</b>

09:38.160 --> 09:40.760
<b>Don't leave me behind!</b>

09:44.460 --> 09:47.640
<b>Damn, guys. Listen to the end.</b>

09:48.060 --> 09:50.380
<b>I'm not badmouthing him.</b>

09:50.810 --> 09:52.280
<b>It's the exact opposite.</b>

09:52.680 --> 09:54.000
<b>I'm praising him.</b>

09:55.040 --> 09:56.890
<b>I thought it was a waste.</b>

09:58.600 --> 10:00.990
<b>Everyone's holding you back.</b>

10:01.980 --> 10:04.610
<b>You're a lot stronger than that.</b>

10:06.400 --> 10:08.380
<b>And if you're like that…</b>

10:09.430 --> 10:11.710
<b>You're better off alone.</b>

10:16.720 --> 10:18.240
<b>Quit spewing crap.</b>

10:19.030 --> 10:23.140
<b>Mouthing off like you know me…</b>

10:24.290 --> 10:26.000
<b>I don't care what anyone says,</b>

10:26.660 --> 10:29.890
<b>you choose where you belong.</b>

10:34.900 --> 10:36.940
<b>Nice. That's a good one.</b>

10:37.850 --> 10:40.280
<b>I wasn't planning on this…</b>

10:45.360 --> 10:47.910
<b>but maybe I'll play with you a little.</b>

10:55.760 --> 10:56.650
<b>Stop this.</b>

10:58.090 --> 10:59.020
<b>Suzuri!</b>

10:59.190 --> 11:01.370
<b>Hey! You're not part of this!</b>

11:01.660 --> 11:05.390
<b>He's right. You're nothing to me now. Butt out.</b>

11:06.200 --> 11:07.860
<b>I'm not nothing to you.</b>

11:08.510 --> 11:12.090
<b>Trace what's happening now back
to its cause, and I'm right there.</b>

11:13.030 --> 11:16.640
<b>You came here to see if I did my job, didn't you?</b>

11:17.750 --> 11:19.530
<b>We can settle this between us.</b>

11:20.610 --> 11:21.570
<b>This is too much.</b>

11:22.670 --> 11:24.990
<b>I can't cause them any more trouble.</b>

11:28.000 --> 11:29.020
<b>Suzuri…</b>

11:30.060 --> 11:32.760
<b>So, please…</b>

11:35.660 --> 11:36.590
<b>Back down.</b>

11:37.870 --> 11:40.490
<b>I'll take responsibility.</b>

11:44.520 --> 11:46.750
<b>S-Suzuri…</b>

11:55.130 --> 11:56.680
<b>Suzuri, run!</b>

12:01.890 --> 12:07.320
<b>I see people prostrate themselves from time
to time, but nobody gets this into it!</b>

12:08.890 --> 12:13.710
<b>That said, really, what a pathetic look this is.</b>

12:14.400 --> 12:16.120
<b>Pros-tra-ting.</b>

12:21.870 --> 12:24.990
<b>Okay, we'll call it even.</b>

12:27.870 --> 12:31.200
<b>The client's got some shady business going on,</b>

12:32.860 --> 12:34.500
<b>so with a little threatening…</b>

12:36.590 --> 12:39.920
<b>he'll probably even leave the girl alone.</b>

12:41.580 --> 12:43.480
<b>What's your angle?</b>

12:43.880 --> 12:45.530
<b>What are you plotting?</b>

12:45.810 --> 12:47.580
<b>Huh? Nothing, really.</b>

12:48.410 --> 12:52.730
<b>If I had to give a reason…
I'm in a good mood, I guess?</b>

12:54.120 --> 12:55.290
<b>I'm sure you are.</b>

12:56.450 --> 12:59.050
<b>This is how you've always been.</b>

12:59.960 --> 13:02.140
<b>Utterly incomprehensible.</b>

13:05.530 --> 13:07.900
<b>Laughing out loud cooled me off.</b>

13:08.670 --> 13:12.110
<b>I'll come play with you again at Furin, real soon.</b>

13:12.780 --> 13:13.880
<b>See ya.</b>

13:14.090 --> 13:16.960
<b>Huh?! Screw you! Wait right there!</b>

13:17.050 --> 13:17.820
<b>Sakura!</b>

13:22.230 --> 13:24.220
<b>I said, see ya,</b>

13:27.890 --> 13:28.860
<b>you child.</b>

13:31.070 --> 13:33.000
<b>Sakura, don't overextend!</b>

13:33.570 --> 13:37.730
<b>You heard him. Gotta listen to your seniors.</b>

13:38.780 --> 13:40.550
<b>You're just a firstie, after all.</b>

13:46.910 --> 13:48.140
<b>Goddammit!</b>

14:03.710 --> 14:06.080
<b>Dammit, that bastard…</b>

14:07.980 --> 14:09.200
<b>I'll get him for that!</b>

14:11.240 --> 14:15.800
<b>S-Sakura, if you eat that fast,
you'll shock your system!</b>

14:18.160 --> 14:19.010
<b>And?</b>

14:26.510 --> 14:28.620
<b>I'm… truly sorry.</b>

14:28.890 --> 14:29.610
<b>Hm?</b>

14:30.950 --> 14:35.220
<b>It's my fault you ended up fighting him…</b>

14:36.890 --> 14:38.210
<b>I didn't even know…</b>

14:38.910 --> 14:42.200
<b>that he was a former Furin.</b>

14:43.880 --> 14:46.220
<b>I really don't know what I can say…</b>

14:46.230 --> 14:48.690
<b>The hell are you apologizing for?</b>

14:50.140 --> 14:51.100
<b>Because I…</b>

14:51.300 --> 14:54.240
<b>He came because you were here, yeah?</b>

14:54.920 --> 14:56.010
<b>So what?</b>

14:58.140 --> 14:59.080
<b>I…</b>

15:00.020 --> 15:02.340
<b>am not pissed that he showed up.</b>

15:02.770 --> 15:04.380
<b>I'm pissed at him.</b>

15:05.810 --> 15:08.100
<b>So quit apologizing already.</b>

15:08.680 --> 15:10.320
<b>It'll just piss me off more.</b>

15:11.530 --> 15:14.700
<b>Agh, dammit! Thinking about it
is pissing me off again!</b>

15:14.750 --> 15:15.890
<b>Whoa there, Sakura!</b>

15:16.140 --> 15:19.590
<b>The hell did he mean, "child"?!
He's only two years older!</b>

15:20.120 --> 15:22.260
<b>Don't worry about it, Suzuri.</b>

15:22.860 --> 15:25.370
<b>We started it, after all.</b>

15:27.340 --> 15:27.920
<b>But…</b>

15:27.930 --> 15:29.260
<b>Enough already!</b>

15:29.700 --> 15:31.340
<b>The food'll get cold!</b>

15:31.770 --> 15:32.750
<b>Hurry up and eat.</b>

15:54.890 --> 15:55.620
<b>So good.</b>

15:59.160 --> 16:00.220
<b>It's so good.</b>

16:01.220 --> 16:02.670
<b>I've never had something…</b>

16:04.040 --> 16:05.060
<b>so good…</b>

16:05.690 --> 16:06.650
<b>in my life.</b>

16:06.780 --> 16:10.270
<b>Is that so? Then eat more! This, too!</b>

16:10.680 --> 16:12.620
<b>- This one's great, too!
- Eat it all!</b>

16:12.680 --> 16:13.610
<b>O-Okay.</b>

16:14.710 --> 16:16.480
<b>Some of them won't eat today!</b>

16:17.020 --> 16:19.290
<b>Why do I get to do what I want?!</b>

16:20.010 --> 16:21.160
<b>Hey, Suzuri.</b>

16:21.660 --> 16:24.270
<b>What was it that you wanted to do?</b>

16:26.210 --> 16:27.810
<b>From what you said earlier,</b>

16:28.290 --> 16:31.280
<b>there must be something you
like or want to do, right?</b>

16:31.820 --> 16:32.880
<b>What is it?</b>

16:41.480 --> 16:42.030
<b>G…</b>

16:43.810 --> 16:44.810
<b>Games.</b>

16:45.530 --> 16:46.670
<b>Games?</b>

16:47.540 --> 16:49.690
<b>Like Reversi, or poker?</b>

16:49.820 --> 16:52.190
<b>No, the ones you play on a TV.</b>

16:52.430 --> 16:57.100
<b>Oh, I get it! So the ones you need a
TV, console, and cartridge for?</b>

16:57.680 --> 16:59.200
<b>That might take time…</b>

16:59.500 --> 17:02.800
<b>Oh, but if you're okay with retro,
I can dig in my closet!</b>

17:03.120 --> 17:05.980
<b>It's okay. I'll work, and use my pay to…</b>

17:05.980 --> 17:06.970
<b>I got 'em.</b>

17:10.420 --> 17:11.530
<b>Let's play!</b>

17:11.770 --> 17:13.920
<b>Oh wow, way to go, Hidaka!</b>

17:19.720 --> 17:22.540
<b>No, no! You're hitting the wrong button!</b>

17:22.890 --> 17:24.330
<b>Aw yeah, I got you!</b>

17:24.380 --> 17:25.730
<b>Ahhh! I fell!</b>

17:25.790 --> 17:27.750
<b>Suzuri, you're going the wrong way!</b>

17:27.800 --> 17:29.750
<b>Dammit, Kanji, get back here!</b>

17:29.870 --> 17:31.280
<b>Go for it, Hidaka.</b>

17:32.060 --> 17:33.880
<b>Yesss, number one!</b>

17:33.890 --> 17:36.370
<b>You always win, Kan!</b>

17:36.380 --> 17:37.970
<b>Gahh, I lost again!</b>

17:39.300 --> 17:40.990
<b>Suzuri came last again!</b>

17:41.610 --> 17:44.780
<b>Well, Suzuri? How's your first time gaming feel?</b>

17:48.020 --> 17:48.650
<b>S…</b>

17:49.500 --> 17:50.350
<b>So fun!</b>

17:51.590 --> 17:52.920
<b>Hear that, Tsubaki?</b>

17:53.240 --> 17:54.030
<b>Bet you're…</b>

17:59.240 --> 18:00.730
<b>I gotta go to the bathroom.</b>

18:04.480 --> 18:06.510
<b>Okay, Sakura, we're rotating players!</b>

18:06.730 --> 18:07.800
<b>You're up next!</b>

18:08.540 --> 18:11.040
<b>Good idea. Here's the controller.</b>

18:11.270 --> 18:12.750
<b>Oh, then I'll also…</b>

18:12.750 --> 18:14.570
<b>No. You're staying in, dumbass.</b>

18:16.680 --> 18:18.980
<b>I've… never done this before.</b>

18:19.240 --> 18:20.720
<b>Ah, that makes sense.</b>

18:20.960 --> 18:25.450
<b>Alright, simple explanation. This is
accelerate, this is brake…</b>

18:36.630 --> 18:38.380
<b>10 Straight Wins</b>

18:36.630 --> 18:38.380
<b>10 Straight Losses</b>

18:38.470 --> 18:40.530
<b>You've gotten a lot better, Suzuri!</b>

18:41.070 --> 18:43.770
<b>Sakura, you need to follow his example.</b>

18:43.810 --> 18:44.430
<b>Huuuuh?!</b>

18:44.440 --> 18:46.830
<b>Meanwhile, Nire's actually really good!</b>

18:46.880 --> 18:48.990
<b>Wait, Suo, phrasing! Phrasing!</b>

18:49.680 --> 18:50.590
<b>Uh, sorry.</b>

18:52.410 --> 18:54.780
<b>One more race, asshole!</b>

18:56.210 --> 18:58.220
<b>Suo, trade places with me!</b>

18:58.270 --> 19:00.970
<b>Whaaat? But I have more fun watching.</b>

19:01.000 --> 19:01.410
<b>Oi!</b>

19:02.970 --> 19:04.220
<b>We go 'til I win!</b>

19:04.570 --> 19:05.910
<b>As long as it takes!</b>

19:06.400 --> 19:07.900
<b>You're not leaving on a win!</b>

19:09.660 --> 19:11.990
<b>You're better off alone.</b>

19:16.300 --> 19:18.080
<b>Okay! I'm with you!</b>

19:27.570 --> 19:28.970
<b>You gonna be okay?</b>

19:29.950 --> 19:30.830
<b>Yeah, I am now.</b>

19:31.150 --> 19:32.180
<b>Not like that.</b>

19:33.820 --> 19:35.160
<b>I meant with Endo.</b>

19:37.800 --> 19:40.510
<b>Yes. I let Ume know.</b>

19:41.000 --> 19:44.010
<b>I know Endo's got beef with Furin,</b>

19:44.660 --> 19:49.220
<b>but for him to actually take
an interest in Sakura here…</b>

19:50.110 --> 19:52.420
<b>I'm not badmouthing him.</b>

19:52.840 --> 19:54.310
<b>It's the exact opposite.</b>

19:54.760 --> 19:56.110
<b>I'm praising him.</b>

19:56.890 --> 20:02.200
<b>He was never the type to outright praise somebody.</b>

20:02.660 --> 20:03.360
<b>Yeah…</b>

20:04.540 --> 20:07.200
<b>With one exception.</b>

20:08.250 --> 20:10.080
<b>Take good care of the kid.</b>

20:10.980 --> 20:13.810
<b>There's no telling what Endo'll try to pull.</b>

20:14.890 --> 20:15.860
<b>I know.</b>

20:25.280 --> 20:27.320
<b>Sakura, Nirei, Suo.</b>

20:27.680 --> 20:28.350
<b>Yeah?</b>

20:29.950 --> 20:31.940
<b>I have a request to make.</b>

20:32.910 --> 20:35.770
<b>Could you come to the roof first thing tomorrow?</b>

20:38.880 --> 20:40.300
<b>You again…?</b>

20:40.870 --> 20:42.430
<b>Don't blame him.</b>

20:43.230 --> 20:44.700
<b>This one's my fault.</b>

20:49.990 --> 20:53.070
<b>And why are there so many people here?</b>

20:55.310 --> 20:58.360
<b>Apparently Ume called them
in after I contacted him.</b>

20:59.050 --> 21:00.350
<b>Anyway, take a seat.</b>

21:00.690 --> 21:02.910
<b>Ugh, fine.</b>

21:02.950 --> 21:05.400
<b>Wait, Sakura, is that it?!</b>

21:05.560 --> 21:07.030
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

21:07.630 --> 21:09.370
<b>I-I mean…</b>

21:09.780 --> 21:14.320
<b>A-All the devas and their aides
are here, which means…</b>

21:15.850 --> 21:19.950
<b>what happened yesterday was just that big a deal.</b>

21:23.700 --> 21:26.160
<b>Ah! You're all here already?!</b>

21:28.780 --> 21:32.810
<b>Dammit, man, you need to learn
to act like a real Primo!</b>

21:32.940 --> 21:35.500
<b>That's unusual. Typically he's here first.</b>

21:36.810 --> 21:38.530
<b>Guess these things happen!</b>

21:38.910 --> 21:41.770
<b>Good morning, Ume! It's totally fine!</b>

21:41.910 --> 21:43.390
<b>Think he overslept?</b>

21:45.470 --> 21:49.000
<b>Sakura, Suo, Nirei. Thanks for coming so early.</b>

21:50.660 --> 21:51.450
<b>Now…</b>

21:52.430 --> 21:53.550
<b>Let's get started!</b>

21:57.000 --> 22:00.000
<b>After the Storm</b>

23:30.640 --> 23:32.800
<b>Sakura, give me a break!</b>

23:32.810 --> 23:34.320
<b>I said we go 'til I win!</b>

23:34.960 --> 23:36.170
<b>Why won't he turn?!</b>

23:36.170 --> 23:38.740
<b>You can't just ride the gas! Use the brakes!</b>

23:38.740 --> 23:40.150
<b>Who the hell uses brakes?!</b>

23:40.590 --> 23:41.270
<b>What now?!</b>

23:41.270 --> 23:44.360
<b>You're driving backwards!
Please never get a license!</b>
